WEBVTT

00:00:04.983 --> 00:00:07.823
(MOURNING DOVE COOING)

00:00:09.303 --> 00:00:10.583
Great!

00:00:13.423 --> 00:00:15.303
Woody! The rocket!

00:00:15.343 --> 00:00:17.863
The match! Yes!

00:00:17.943 --> 00:00:19.863
Thank you, Sid!

00:00:21.263 --> 00:00:23.623
(CAR APPROACHING)

00:00:26.983 --> 00:00:29.103
No! No, no! No!

00:00:29.143 --> 00:00:32.663
No! Oh, no!

00:00:32.703 --> 00:00:36.543
No, no, no, no, no,

00:00:36.623 --> 00:00:38.423
no!

00:00:38.503 --> 00:00:40.223
(SOBS) No!

00:00:49.143 --> 00:00:52.343
-Woody! What are you doing?
-Hold still, Buzz!

00:00:53.943 --> 00:00:56.103
-Ha-ha! Ha-ha!
-You did it!

00:00:56.463 --> 00:00:58.023
Next stop, Andy!

00:00:58.103 --> 00:01:02.223
Wait a minute. I just lit a rocket.
Rockets explode!

00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:09.823
(LIPS FLAPPING)

00:01:12.463 --> 00:01:15.303
I should have held on longer.

00:01:15.383 --> 00:01:18.503
Look! Look! It's Woody
and Buzz comin' up fast!

00:01:19.423 --> 00:01:21.023
Woody!

00:01:29.383 --> 00:01:31.423
REX: Aah! Take cover!

00:01:37.783 --> 00:01:40.903
Aaah! This is the part
where we blow up!

00:01:40.943 --> 00:01:42.383
Not today!

00:01:45.383 --> 00:01:47.743
(FIREWORKS CRACKLING)

00:01:48.703 --> 00:01:50.303
Aaah!

00:01:53.943 --> 00:01:56.143
Hey, Buzz!
You're flyin'!

00:01:56.223 --> 00:01:59.543
This isn't flying.
This is falling with style.

00:02:00.983 --> 00:02:02.303
WOODY: Ha-ha-ha!

00:02:02.383 --> 00:02:06.503
To infinity and beyond!

00:02:11.823 --> 00:02:14.783
Uh, Buzz,
we missed the truck.

00:02:14.823 --> 00:02:16.943
We're not aiming for the truck.

00:02:20.503 --> 00:02:22.703
(THUDDING)

00:02:23.663 --> 00:02:24.703
Hey, wow!

00:02:24.783 --> 00:02:26.943
-MOTHER: What? What is it?
-Woody! Buzz!

00:02:27.023 --> 00:02:29.103
Oh, great, you found them.
Where were they?

00:02:29.143 --> 00:02:31.223
-Here in the car!
-See?

00:02:31.263 --> 00:02:34.623
Now, what'd I tell you?
Right where you left 'em.

00:02:40.023 --> 00:02:42.263
(GIGGLES)

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:46.863
-Which one can I open first?
-Let's let Molly open one.

00:02:52.703 --> 00:02:54.103
SERGEANT:
Frankincense, this is Myrrh.

00:02:54.143 --> 00:02:56.463
Hey, heads up, everybody.
It's show time.

00:02:56.503 --> 00:02:58.423
Whoa! It's time!

00:02:59.543 --> 00:03:01.903
Ohh! Oh, Bo.

00:03:02.023 --> 00:03:04.343
There's got to be a less painful way
to get my attention.

00:03:04.423 --> 00:03:06.543
Merry Christmas, sheriff.

00:03:07.663 --> 00:03:10.063
-Say, isn't that mistletoe?
-Mm-hmm.

00:03:10.143 --> 00:03:12.503
-Ooh!
-(KISSING SOUNDS, BO GIGGLES)

00:03:12.583 --> 00:03:16.143
Maybe Andy will get another dinosaur.
Like a leaf eater.

00:03:16.183 --> 00:03:19.543
That way I could play the,
uh, dominant predator.

00:03:19.623 --> 00:03:20.663
Quiet, everyone! Quiet!

00:03:20.743 --> 00:03:24.503
SERGEANT: Molly's first
present is Mrs. Potato Head.

00:03:24.543 --> 00:03:26.583
Repeat, a Mrs. Potato Head.

00:03:26.663 --> 00:03:28.703
Way to go, Idaho!

00:03:28.783 --> 00:03:30.863
Gee, I'd better shave.

00:03:34.743 --> 00:03:36.983
-(RADIO WHINING)
-SERGEANT: Come in, Frankincense.

00:03:37.023 --> 00:03:39.063
Andy is now opening
his first present.

00:03:39.143 --> 00:03:41.943
-It's... (STATIC)
-Buzz. Buzz Lightyear,

00:03:42.023 --> 00:03:44.023
-you are not worried, are you?
-SERGEANT: I can't quite...

00:03:44.063 --> 00:03:45.463
-Me? No, no. Pfft.
-SERGEANT: Make out...

00:03:45.503 --> 00:03:48.223
No. No, no, no, no. Mm-mm.

00:03:48.303 --> 00:03:50.663
SERGEANT: A large box... It's-It's-It's...

00:03:50.703 --> 00:03:53.343
-Are you?
-(CHUCKLES) Now, Buzz,

00:03:53.423 --> 00:03:57.663
what could Andy possibly get
that is worse than you?

00:03:58.983 --> 00:04:00.703
ANDY ON MONITOR:
Oh, what is it? What is it?

00:04:00.783 --> 00:04:02.743
-(PUPPY BARKING)
-ANDY: Wow! A puppy!

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:05.303
(CHUCKLES)

00:04:13.463 --> 00:04:17.703
♪ Ooo, ooo, ooo, ooo

00:04:17.823 --> 00:04:21.063
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:04:22.303 --> 00:04:25.343
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:04:26.543 --> 00:04:29.743
♪ When the road looks rough ahead

00:04:29.823 --> 00:04:34.823
♪ And you're miles and miles
from your nice, warm bed

00:04:34.903 --> 00:04:38.223
♪ You just remember
what your old pal said

00:04:38.303 --> 00:04:41.063
♪ Boy, you've got a friend in me

00:04:42.583 --> 00:04:46.263
♪ Yeah, you've got a friend in me

00:04:51.623 --> 00:04:54.623
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:04:55.823 --> 00:04:58.423
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:05:00.103 --> 00:05:04.143
-♪ You got troubles
-♪ And I got 'em too

00:05:04.223 --> 00:05:08.263
♪ There isn't anything
I wouldn't do for you

00:05:08.343 --> 00:05:11.383
♪ If we stick together
we can see it through

00:05:11.423 --> 00:05:14.783
♪ 'Cause you've got a friend in me

00:05:16.583 --> 00:05:19.103
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:05:20.943 --> 00:05:24.943
♪ Some other folks might be
a little bit smarter than I am

00:05:24.983 --> 00:05:27.983
♪ Bigger and stronger too

00:05:28.063 --> 00:05:29.183
♪ Maybe

00:05:29.263 --> 00:05:34.943
♪ But none of them will ever love you
the way I do

00:05:35.023 --> 00:05:37.623
TOGETHER: ♪ It's me and you, boy

00:05:37.663 --> 00:05:41.143
♪ And as the years go by

00:05:41.183 --> 00:05:44.263
♪ Our friendship will never die

00:05:45.823 --> 00:05:50.663
♪ You're gonna see it's our destiny

00:05:50.703 --> 00:05:54.663
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:05:54.743 --> 00:05:57.303
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:05:58.983 --> 00:06:01.423
♪ You've got a friend in me ♪

